        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Umihara Kawase is a series of platform games, starring a nineteen-year-old Japanese school girl (Kawase Umihara), who has somehow become lost in a world of mutated salt-water and fresh-water creatures. The Umihara Kawase games' main distinction are their tranquil fish and bird infested worlds and the rope physics, which defines the gameplay.\n\nThis is the third game of the series.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Umihara Kawase es una serie de juegos de plataformas protagonizada por una colegiala japonesa de diecinueve años (Kawase Umihara), que de alguna manera se ha perdido en un mundo de criaturas mutadas de agua salada y dulce. La principal distinción de los juegos de Umihara Kawase son sus mundos tranquilos, plagados de peces y aves, y la física de cuerdas, que define la jugabilidad.\n\nEste es el tercer juego de la serie.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2013",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
