        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Umihara Kawase Shun is the second installment in the grappling hook-centric Umihara Kawase series. As in the previous game, Shun revolves around traversing levels with only a fishing rod that can attach itself to level geometry and taking advantage of physics to reach seemingly difficult places.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Umihara Kawase Shun es la segunda entrega de la serie Umihara Kawase, centrada en el gancho de agarre. Como en el juego anterior, Shun gira en torno a recorrer niveles con solo una caña de pescar que puede engancharse a la geometría del nivel, aprovechando la física para llegar a lugares aparentemente difíciles.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
